Corrected message:

Ignore extra mouse buttons pressed during a Recolor stroke

Pressing a second mouse button while a Recolor stroke was held could
switch the rest of the stroke between primary-to-secondary and
secondary-to-primary, and restarted its record of pixels already
recoloured. The Recolor tool now ignores such presses until the stroke
ends, as the other brush tools already do.

Adds a regression test.
